  lines:
  - characterName: Ghost
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4064d2c433ff4b84b93308dcba9b07d6,
      type: 3}
    dialogueText: Wow! You got it right!
  - characterName: You
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f1626c2b086030d498fbee7a5da51299,
      type: 3}
    dialogueText: So the supernatural object came from a meteor... What about the
      villagers? They were affected by its radiation and changed form... could it
      be that earlier...
  - characterName: Ghost
    characterPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4064d2c433ff4b84b93308dcba9b07d6,
      type: 3}
    dialogueText: Mm! Did you guess it?
